    <node id="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. EZPass by BLR is a PreSecure Lane that lets you choose a preferred time window to join the security check queue at Terminal 1, Zone D. It is a timed entry pass for the queue only, so it does not skip or fast-track security screening. Terminal 1 Options &gt; EZPass by BLR &gt; Zone: Terminal 1 - Zone D security checkpoint, Level 0 &gt; You can book a slot through the BLR Pulse app after completing web check-in. Entry to the queue starts 4 hours before scheduled departure, and bookings are not allowed within 60 minutes of departure. Please keep your QR code and boarding pass ready when you arrive. &gt; Reference: [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/ezpass) If you would like, I can also help you with how to book it step by step.">
      <data key="d0">chatbot_response</data>
      <data key="d1">Namaskara from Bangalore International A</data>
      <data key="d2">book a slot through the BLR Pulse app</data>
      <data key="d3">1</data>
    </node>
