    <edge source="Which terminal handles Lufthansa flights?" target="Namaskara from Bangalore International Airport Limited. Thank you for contacting us. Lufthansa international flights operate from Terminal 2 at BLR. If you are heading there, please follow the international departure signs for the correct check-in and security area. Terminal 2 Options &gt; Lufthansa &gt; Zone: Terminal 2 - International Departures &gt; Reference: [Click here for more details](https://www.bengaluruairport.com/travellers/flights/airline-partners-information)" id="has_reference_response">
      <data key="d4">has_reference_response</data>
      <data key="d5">1</data>
    </edge>
